{"id": 50, "name": "Zhask", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/f/fe/Hero501-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021141834", "cls": ["Mage", ""], "specialty": ["Chase", "Damage"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["10", "100", "40", "40"], "lanes": ["Mid Lane", ""], "story": "King of the Swarm who disrupts the balance of the universe.", "skills": [{"name": "Decimation", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c917fad570226db1fe802ef590ce37dc.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Upon death, Zhask summons a frenzied <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Nightmaric Spawn</span> on the spot, which gradually loses HP over time until death."}, {"name": "Nightmaric Spawn", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4d3d9495ced41a0034c6ae2f3c8abb23.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 13   Mana Cost: 60", "desc": "Zhask summons a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Nightmaric Spawn</span> that inherits 55% of his Attributes (HP, Hybrid Defense, and Magic Power). It automatically attacks nearby enemies by firing a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Death Ray</span>, dealing 55 (+<span style=\"color:#26e407\">20% extra Attack Speed</span>) (+<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">20% Magic Power</span>) <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and slowing them by up to 30%. It disappears if Zhask is too far away.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Death Ray</span> is considered a Basic Attack but cannot Crit.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fusion Enhanced</span>: The damage of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Nightmaric Spawn</span> is increased to 180%, and it can be repositioned."}, {"name": "Mind Eater", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4738fbff79c44b4aa3bd2bd943840032.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Zhask fires a penetrating psychic beam in the target direction, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+100% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. Afterward, the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Nightmaric Spawn</span> attacks enemies hit by <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Mind Eater</span>, dealing 120<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+80% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and stunning them for 0.5s.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fusion Enhanced</span>: <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Mind Eater</span> damage is increased to 540<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+180% Total Magic Power)</span>."}, {"name": "Hive Clones", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_47dcb2a530907fafc065d9363e941bae.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10   Mana Cost: 60", "desc": "Zhask releases a swarm of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Hive Clones</span> in the target direction. The clones explode upon hitting an enemy, dealing 55<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+18% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and reducing their Movement Speed by 80% for 1s.\nIf the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Hive Clones</span> hit no target, they burrow into the ground to ambush passing enemies.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fusion Enhanced</span>: Zhask releases several swarms of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Hive Clones</span>.\nSubsequent damage to the same target decays to 20%."}, {"name": "Dominator's Descent", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3174faca2ab0b0d6c0dd9d1af22f47df.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 72, "tagname": "Morph", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 48   Mana Cost: 120", "desc": "Zhask selects a target area to summon an enhanced <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Nightmaric Spawn</span> and fuses with it. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Nightmaric Spawn</span> can inherit 100% of his attributes and get extra attributes. His skills are enhanced during the fusion period.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Zhask immediately gets off the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Nightmaric Spawn</span> and loses enhancement."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Arcane Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1a0d5709c23c25849cca889cb1303ecb.png"}, {"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a80160d168038deb13d7d93ec41c8401.png"}, {"name": "Glowing Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_df12c0f80844640a7b40cf64798be915.png"}, {"name": "Holy Crystal", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_25c17fb08406548b8476673ce7fc3078.png"}, {"name": "Divine Glaive", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ef0ab8d629f06ebd67cf2b65e144f803.png"}, {"name": "Lightning Truncheon", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ff18dc8e5abef3934886191fe6c161a0.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Mage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c7febdebe70929be98c7007af3cd0f3a.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Rupture", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8e7a237c8961044ad43af1a79d5b3756.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Weapons Master", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_893891a86726cbf0b00401127a1f9486.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "Impure Rage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_30fc47f40c0ef7fb770d98d6f570f404.png", "tier": 3}], "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https